  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 15.16.0\n        - Updated SoundFingerprinting to 15.16.0: FFmpegAudioService crops a frame region out of the decoded frames of every file when the video fingerprint configuration carries an IFrameCropSink (VideoFingerprintConfiguration.FrameCropSink, AVFingerprintConfiguration.WithFrameCropSink).\n        - FFmpegAudioService has one public constructor, FFmpegAudioService(ILoggerFactory?); SupportedFormats now lists the demuxer names of the loaded FFmpeg build (read once, lazily) instead of a static list.\n        - AVStreamingPublishOptions.MediaServiceFactory is Func<string, IMediaService>; the publish worker hands its frame crop sink to the media service through the fingerprint configuration.\n        Version 15.14.1\n        - Updated SoundFingerprinting to 15.14.1 to recover retrospective cut-off occurrences, retain fixed-axis matching, and remove timestamp-origin-dependent match selection.\n        Version 15.3.0\n        - Updated SoundFingerprinting dependency to 15.3.0 (ComputeSpectralProfile now defaults to true, so fingerprinted tracks carry the per-second spectral profile out of the box).\n        Version 15.2.0\n        - Updated SoundFingerprinting dependency to 15.2.0 (MatchedWithType provenance on matches, TruePositivesFilter.ignoreBridgedCoverage, SilenceBridgingStrategy rename).\n        - SimilarTracksQuery's true-positives filter now ignores bridged coverage by default — only real fingerprint anchors count toward the coverage bar — so spectral bridging can no longer inflate a coincidental cross-advertiser match over the threshold. \n        Version 15.1.0\n        - Updated SoundFingerprinting dependency to 15.1.0 (windowed spectral-profile bridging, order-independent CompositeBridgingStrategy, per-strategy bridge caps).\n        - SimilarTracksQuery now bridges noisy/quiet gaps with the windowed broadband + silent composite, fully recovering cross-station ad matches that previously matched only partially.\n        Version 15.0.9\n        - Updated SoundFingerprinting dependency to 15.0.9 (fixed Hashes.GetRange for spectral profiles)\n        Version 15.0.4\n        - Fixed FFmpegTranscoder JIFF marker update\n        Version 15.0.0\n        - Upgraded SoundFingerprinting dependency to 15.0.0\n        Version 14.0.0\n        - Upgraded SoundFingerprinting dependency to 14.0.0\n        - Updated FFmpeg.AutoGen to v8.0.0\n        Version 12.7.0\n        - Updated SoundFingerprinting dependency to 12.7.0",
